  "prefLabel": "He-C 901.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 901.01 Purpose.\n\n(a) The purpose of this part is to set forth the uniform standards and requirements for how the department reviews records maintained by facilities regarding the use of seclusion and restraint as described in RSA 126-U:9, I(a).\n\n(b) This part also establishes a uniform process for how the department receives and investigates complaints of improper use of seclusion and restraint in facilities as described in RSA 126-U:9, I(b).\n\nSource. #13135, eff 11-24-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c900.html"
}
